# Every text file is LF in the working tree and in the index, on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The Content-Security-Policy hashes in orange_skin.html do not depend on this: the browser converts CRLF to
# LF while parsing the page, before it hashes an inline block, and scripts/csp.js hashes the same LF text.
* text=auto eol=lf
